  "summary": "The ACP BACnet gateway serves each LG air-to-water heat pump on its LG-NET as a fixed block of 23 BACnet IP objects on the gateway's AWHP device (Device ID + 4). The block has run/stop, mode, room, hot water and leaving water setpoints, hot water on/off, water and tank temperatures, alarm and error code.",
