  ],
  "firmware": null,
  "default_device_instance": 9004,
  "access_inferred": true,
  "notes": [
    "Instance = 4 x 65536 + unit address x 256 + point number (product type 4 = AWHP). Instances here are for address 00, so point 1 = BO 262145.",
    "AWHP objects sit on their own BACnet device: the gateway Device ID (default 9000) + 4.",
    "The AWHP table prints no units, and no state texts for the hot water on/off points (18, 19).",
    "The manual has no read/write column: access is inferred from the object type and the setting/status labels."
  ],
